=== HINT 1 ===
Variable declaration syntax:   type name = value;
Examples:
  int x = 5;
  double y = 3.14;
  char c = 'Z';

=== HINT 2 ===
For decimal numbers use 'double', not 'float', to get %.2f to print correctly.

=== HINT 3 (SPOILER) ===
int    age    = 30;
double height = 1.75;
char   grade  = 'A';
